{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44920","headline":"送李使君赴琼州兼五州招讨使 · 无可","name":"送李使君赴琼州兼五州招讨使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分竹雄兼使，南方到海行。\n临门双斾引，隔岭五州迎。\n猨鹤同枝宿，兰蕉夹道生。\n云垂前骑失，山豁去帆轻。\n雨雾蒸秋岸，浪涛震夜城。\n政闲开迥阁，欹枕岛风清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}